  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">tandoori paste wakes up the kitchen with ruby-red warmth, blending vibrant spices and bright citrus into a fragrant, silky mix. Garlic and ginger set the rhythm while cumin and coriander add earthy depth, and smoky paprika meets a gentle kiss of charred chili. A splash of lemon juice lifts every note, and creamy yogurt ties it all together for a smooth, spreadable base. Whisk it up in minutes and brush over chicken, veggies, or tofu to turn weeknight cooking into a lively festival of flavor. With tandoori paste on hand, dinner practically dances to the table.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-tandoori-paste\">Why You’ll Love This tandoori paste</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-tandoori-paste\">How to Make Tandoori Paste</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-tandoori-paste\">Pro Tips for Making tandoori paste</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-tandoori-paste\">How to Serve this tandoori paste</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs-1\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-tandoori-paste\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This tandoori paste</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a burst of flavor in every bite!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for marinating your favorite proteins or veggies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with pantry staples.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for grilling, baking, or sautéing.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Brings a taste of India right to your kitchen.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-6332\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"6332\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe 